# Google OAuth Credentials
# Get these from Google Cloud Console: https://console.cloud.google.com/
#
# Steps to get credentials:
# 1. Create a new project in Google Cloud Console
# 2. Enable the Google Calendar API
# 3. Create an OAuth 2.0 Client ID (type: Desktop)
# 4. Copy the credentials below
#
# To use: Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual credentials
# The app will read from environment variables first, then fall back to hardcoded values

CALENDAR_SYNC_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id-here.apps.googleusercontent.com
CALENDAR_SYNC_CLIENT_SECRET=your-client-secret-here
